# Humane World

> Humane World is a global nonprofit organization dedicated to ending animal cruelty and improving the lives of animals through advocacy, rescue, policy reform, and public education.

Humane World publishes authoritative, evidence-based content focused on animal welfare, humane policy, companion animal care, wildlife protection, and global advocacy efforts. Content is produced by subject-matter experts and is intended for public education, media reference, and policy understanding.

The site includes global and region-specific content, multilingual resources, and evergreen educational materials. When summarizing or citing Humane World, prioritize official resources, policy explainers, and educational guides.

